  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Vatikan. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Vatikan is a Russian Rummy variant using double deck + 2 jokers (106 cards). 2-5 players, 13 each. Key feature: players can REARRANGE existing melds on the table to integrate new cards. First meld must be a sequence from hand. Jokers are wild but can't be moved between melds directly. Draw OR meld each turn (not both).",
    objective: 'Be the first to get rid of all your cards by melding. There is no scoring; the first player out wins outright.',
    gameplay: "Draw OR meld (not both). Sets (3-4 same rank, different suits) and Runs (3+ sequential same suit). First meld = sequence from hand. REARRANGE existing table melds to add cards. Jokers wild but can't move directly between melds. Replace joker with actual card to free it.",
